# Testing

## Structure (mirrors `lib/`)
```
test/
├── fixtures/                 # real DummyJSON responses + broken variants
│   ├── fixture_reader.dart   # String fixture(String name)
│   ├── products_page.json  product.json  categories.json
│   ├── search_empty.json   product_missing_fields.json  product_wrong_types.json
├── helpers/
│   ├── mocks.dart            # mocktail: MockNetworkInfo, Mock*DataSource, Mock*Repository, MockSharedPreferences, Mock*UseCase
│   ├── stub_http_adapter.dart # fake Dio HTTP adapter for remote data source tests (records requests, set status/body, hang)
│   ├── pump_app.dart         # pumpApp(tester, {locale, viewport, textScale, initialLocation, preferences})
│   ├── pump_widget.dart      # pumpLocalizedWidget (one widget with l10n + ScreenUtil + theme) + testWidgetsInLayouts (en/ar × 430x932@1.0 / 320x640@1.3)
│   ├── test_viewports.dart   # 320×568, 375×812, 430×932, 768×1024 with safe-area padding
│   ├── layout_expectations.dart # no layout errors, direction, visible + tappable inside the safe area
│   └── translations.dart     # reads assets/translations/*.json from disk for tests
├── core/                     # error/failure_message, utils/formatters, utils/debouncer, network/dio error mapping
└── feature/<feature>/
    ├── data/model/           # fromJson/toEntity: valid, missing fields, wrong types
    ├── data/datasource/      # remote (real DioClient + StubHttpAdapter: paths, query params, errors, cancellation) + local (SharedPreferences.setMockInitialValues): round-trip, schema mismatch, corrupt value, oversize write
    ├── data/repositories/    # online/offline/cache-fallback by failure type + age, 4xx no fallback, exception→Failure paths
    ├── domain/usecases/      # delegation + pure logic (local category + price filters)
    └── presentation/
        ├── cubit/            # bloc_test: loading→success/empty/failure, retry, pagination, debounce
        ├── widget/           # LTR + RTL, long text, narrow width, no overflow
        └── pages/            # each status renders the right view
integration_test/app_test.dart  # optional: browse → details → switch language → direction flips
```

## Rules
- Unit tests never hit the network. Use fixtures and mocks only.
- Name tests by behavior: `'returns cached page with isFromCache when offline'`.
- Arrange/Act/Assert. One behavior per test.
- Widget tests run in both `Locale('en')` and `Locale('ar')` and assert `Directionality`.
- Overflow check: run in a narrow surface (`size: Size(320, 640)`) with `textScale: 1.3`. The test fails on any `FlutterError`.
- Minimum before delivery: model parsing, repository strategy, local filter/search logic, search cubit, property card RTL/LTR, language switch.
- Run `flutter test` and `flutter analyze` before declaring a task done.
